# Copy this file to .env and fill in the values from your Firebase project.
#
# Where to find these:
# 1. Go to https://console.firebase.google.com
# 2. Create a project (or select an existing one)
# 3. In Project settings > General, scroll to "Your apps" and add a Web app
# 4. Firebase gives you a firebaseConfig object — copy each value below
# 5. In Build > Authentication > Sign-in method, enable "Email/Password"
# 6. In Build > Firestore Database, create a database (start in production mode)
# 7. Paste the contents of firestore.rules into Firestore's Rules tab and publish

